# Commits that only moved whitespace around. `git blame` skips these so the
# line-by-line history still points at whoever wrote the code, not at whoever
# ran the formatter.
#
# Enable it once per clone:
#   git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
# (GitHub's blame view reads this file automatically, no config needed.)
#
